ai dunia eSports, gaming, dan live event.","type":"live_tv","image_square":"https:\\/\\/pic.dens.tv\\/tv_183x174\\/1568359881_square.jpg","image_landscape":"","image_potrait":"","category":"1","trailer_url":""},{"no":"7","id":"117","title":"DensFood Channel","slug":"densfood-channel","description":"DensFood Channel merupakan in-house Dens.TV yang menghadirkan konten menginspirasi seputar kuliner dan memasak.","type":"live_tv","image_square":"https:\\/\\/pic.dens.tv\\/tv_183x174\\/Dens_Food_Channel_(Trial)_1.jpg","image_landscape":"","image_potrait":"","category":"1","trailer_url":""},{"no":"8","id":"127","title":"Crema TV","slug":"crema-tv","description":"Crema TV menghadirkan channel lifestyle tentang dunia kopi.","type":"live_tv","image_square":"https:\\/\\/pic.dens.tv\\/tv_183x174\\/1701422013_square.jpg","image_landscape":"","image_potrait":"","category":"2","trailer_url":""},{"no":"9","id":"61","title":"CNA","slug":"cna","description":"CNA meyajikan berita TV Asia berbahasa Inggris yang disiarkan 24 jam. Melaporkan perkembangan global dengan perspektif Asia.","type":"live_tv","image_square":"https:\\/\\/pic.dens.tv\\/tv_183x174\\/1554879496_square.jpg","image_landscape":"","image_potrait":"","category":"3","trailer_url":""},{"no":"10","id":"77","title":"NHK WORLD-JAPAN","slug":"nhk-world-japan","description":"NHK WORLD-JAPAN menghadirkan program berita domestik dan internasional. Selain berita, ini menghadirkan juga program hiburan, gaya hidup, dan dokumenter. (www.nhk.or.jp\\/nhkworld)","type":"live_tv","image_square":"https:\\/\\/pic.dens.tv\\/tv_183x174\\/1523415496_square.jpg","image_landscape":"","image_potrait":"","category":"3","trailer_url":""}]', 'Y', '2023-11-22 10:47:36', '2025-11-17 06:56:10', '/top/section/update_section'),
(15, 'Ketinggalan? Nonton di Sini', '1', 'N', '2', '[{"no":"1","id":"25","title":"DPM : Dewan Perwakilan Mobile Legends Eps.50 ","slug":"dpm-dewan-perwakilan-mobile-legends-eps50","description":"DPM: Dewan Perwakilan Mobile Legends melakukan rapat yang Dipandu oleh Sekretaris Dewan Awl dan Wakil Ketua Dewan Pak Pulung, bersama Anggota Dewan Baru yaitu Talitha Shahiza, caster MDL, untuk membahas perjalanan kariernya di dunia esports sekaligus mengupas perkembangan kompetisi Mobile Legends Indonesia. Episode ini akan mengulik perjalanan Talitha dalam membangun karier sebagai caster, tantangan di balik profesinya, serta bagaimana seorang caster membaca pertandingan dari sisi strategi, momentum, dan performa pemain. Memasuki pembahasan utama, Talitha akan melakukan breakdown MPL ID Season 18 Week 7, mulai dari performa tim, strategi dan draft, hingga persaingan menuju playoff. Dengan perspektif caster dan analisis yang tajam, episode ini menghadirkan insight mengenai tim-tim yang sedang naik, mengalami tekanan, maupun berpotensi menjadi kejutan di fase akhir regular season.","type":"catchup_schedule","image_square":"","image_landscape":"https:\\/\\/picture.dens.tv\\/wp\\/img\\/top_tvshowbanner_v1\\/1280x720\\/1791885128_top_tvshowbanner_v1.jpg","image_potrait":"https:\\/\\/picture.dens.tv\\/wp\\/img\\/top_tvshowpotrait_v1\\/575x1028\\/1767337960_top_tvshowpotrait_v1.jpg","trailer_url":"","category_channel":"1","id_channel":"107","catchup_day_limit_web":"7","catchup_day_limit_stb":"7","catchup_day_limit_android":"7","catchup_day_limit_ios":"7","starttime":1791541800,"endtime":1791545400,"stream_url_web":"https:\\/\\/op-flashcon-digdayacatchup-2.dens.tv\\/tvod\\/tvod8p.m3u8?code=s101p&starttime=1791541800&endtime=1791545400","stream_url_stb":"http:\\/\\/op-flashcon-digdayacatchup-2.dens.tv\\/tvod\\/tvod8p.m3u8?code=s101p&starttime=1791541800&endtime=1791545400","stream_url_android":"http:\\/\\/op-flashcon-digdayacatchup-2.dens.tv\\/tvod\\/tvod8p.m3u8?code=s101p&starttime=1791541800&endtime=1791545400","stream_url_ios":"http:\\/\\/op-flashcon-digdayacatchup-2.dens.tv\\/tvod\\/tvod8p.m3u8?code=s101p&starttime=1791541800&endtime=1791545400"},{"no":"2","id":"22","title":"Sinema Hits Eps. 11","slug":"sinema-hits-eps-11","description":"\\"Kali ini Sinema Hits kedatangan vampir lokal Indonesia, yaitu Kimberly Ryder, Satine Zaneta, dan Ajil Ditto! Bersama Diaz Danar, mereka berbagi cerita di balik layar serta membahas premis menarik dari film Siti Si Vampir. \\nMenariknya, Satine Zaneta harus mempelajari bahasa Bekasi yang jarang ia gunakan demi mendalami karakternya. Penasaran dengan keseruan dan tantangan mereka selama proses syuting? Simak obrolan lengkapnya di Sinema Hits!\\"","type":"catchup_schedule","image_square":"","image_landscape":"https:\\/\\/picture.dens.tv\\/wp\\/img\\/top_tvshowbanner_v1\\/1280x720\\/1791885134_top_tvshowbanner_v1.jpg","image_potrait":"https:\\/\\/picture.dens.tv\\/wp\\/img\\/top_tvshowpotrait_v1\\/575x1028\\/1767336963_top_tvshowpotrait_v1.jpg","trailer_url":"","category_channel":"1","id_channel":"102","catchup_day_limit_web":"7","catchup_day_limit_stb":"7","catchup_day_limit_android":"7","catchup_day_limit_ios":"7","starttime":1791549000,"endtime":1791552600,"stream_url_web":"https:\\/\\/op-flashcon-digdayacatchup-2.dens.tv\\/tvod\\/tvod8p.m3u8?code=s113&starttime=1791549000&endtime=1791552600","stream_url_stb":"http:\\/\\/op-flashcon-digdayacatchup-2.dens.tv\\/tvod\\/tvod8p.m3u8?code=s113&starttime=1791549000&endtime=1791552600","stream_url_android":"http:\\/\\/op-flashcon-digdayacatchup-2.dens.tv\\/tvod\\/tvod8p.m3u8?code=s113&starttime=1791549000&endtime=1791552600","stream_url_ios":"http:\\/\\/op-flashcon-digdayacatchup-2.dens.tv\\/tvod\\/tvod8p.m3u8?code=s113&starttime=1791549000&endtime=1791552600"},{"no":"3","id":"109","title":"Ramen(in) Eps.3","slug":"ramenin-eps3","description":"Chef Azhari mendapat sebuah bungkusan yang mencurigakan yang ternyata didalamnya berisi berbagai jenis cabai yang menumpu