(22, '11 Horror Tales', '4', 'N', '', '[{"no":"1","id":"4806","title":"Demonic Beauty | Rated : PG - 13","slug":"demonic-beauty-rated-pg-13","description":"Konten ini milik Cipta Mutu Entertainment. Arawati, seorang putri Khmer, dipaksa untuk menikahi tiran penakluk rezim.","type":"vod","image_square":"","image_landscape":"https:\\/\\/op-picture.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/lands\\/1640077974_land.jpg","image_potrait":"https:\\/\\/op-picture.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/port\\/Demonic-Beauty-(Portrait).jpg"},{"no":"2","id":"4804","title":"Haunted Universities | Rated : PG - 13","slug":"haunted-universities-rated-pg-13","description":"Konten ini milik Cipta Mutu Entertainment. Antologi horor yang menampilkan kisah siswa yang berurusan dengan entitas paranormal. ","type":"vod","image_square":"","image_landscape":"https:\\/\\/op-picture.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/lands\\/1640077334_land.jpg","image_potrait":"https:\\/\\/op-picture.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/port\\/haunted-Universities-(portrait).jpg"},{"no":"3","id":"6232","title":"Sadako 2 | Rated : PG-13","slug":"sadako-2-rated-pg-13","description":"Konten ini milik PT Cipta Mutu (My Cinema Asia). Fuko Ando diminta mengurus keponakannya yang berusia 4 tahun. Namun dia tidak menyangka hal ini membuatnya menghadapi peristiwa mengerikan dari video terkutuk yang ditemukannya.","type":"vod","image_square":"","image_landscape":"https:\\/\\/op-picture.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/lands\\/1674119463_land.jpg","image_potrait":"https:\\/\\/op-picture.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/port\\/Sadako2_549x825.jpg"},{"no":"4","id":"5864","title":"The Mother | Rated : Rated","slug":"the-mother-rated-rated","description":"Konten ini milik PT Cipta Mutu Entertainment. (My Cinema Asia). Sebuah keluarga pindah ke luar kota untuk membesarkan putri autis dengan damai. Rumah bergaya kolonial baru penuh dengan foto lama yang diambil dengan proses kaca basah. Gadis itu berubah, dia tidur di siang hari dan bangun di malam hari.","type":"vod","image_square":"","image_landscape":"https:\\/\\/op-picture.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/lands\\/1666152967_land.jpg","image_potrait":"https:\\/\\/op-picture.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/port\\/The-Mother549x825.jpg"},{"no":"5","id":"5862","title":"The Ring | Rated : Not Rated","slug":"the-ring-rated-not-rated","description":"Konten ini milik PT Cipta Mutu (My Cinema Asia). Seorang reporter dan mantan suaminya menyelidiki rekaman video terkutuk yang dikabarkan akan membunuh penontonnya tujuh hari setelah menontonnya.","type":"vod","image_square":"","image_landscape":"https:\\/\\/op-picture.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/lands\\/1666152259_land.jpg","image_potrait":"https:\\/\\/op-picture.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/port\\/Ring549x825.jpg"},{"no":"6","id":"7930","title":"Conjuring Spirit | Rated : PG-13","slug":"conjuring-spirit-rated-pg-13","description":"Content Rights: Thrill.\\nSinopsis: Setelah pengkhianatan suaminya, seorang penulis bernama Lan pindah ke sebuah apartemen tua bersama anaknya. ","type":"vod","image_square":"","image_landscape":"http:\\/\\/pic.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/lands\\/Conjuring-Spirit1280x720@3x.jpg","image_potrait":"http:\\/\\/pic.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/port\\/Conjuring-Spirit549x825@3x (1).jpg"},{"no":"7","id":"7285","title":"Memoir | Rated : PG-13","slug":"memoir-rated-pg-13","description":"Content Rights: Thrill.\\nSinopsis: Kehidupan Duranee, seorang pekerja di toko serba ada, berubah. Semua karena ia bertemu dengan Yo, tokoh misterius yang Duranee jadikan target untuk membuat Yo membeli asuransi darinya.","type":"vod","image_square":"","image_landscape":"http:\\/\\/pic.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/lands\\/Memoir1280x720@3x.jpg","image_potrait":"http:\\/\\/pic.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/port\\/Memoir549x825@3x.jpg"},{"no":"8","id":"4778","title":"The Cadaver | Rated : PG - 13","slug":"the-cadaver-rated-pg-13","description":"Konten ini milik Cipta Mutu Entertainment. Mai adalah seorang mahasiswa kedokteran yang memiliki pengalaman menakutkan ketika bekerja dengan mayat eksperimental saat melakukan penelitian anatominya. Dia dihantui oleh hantu wanita yang terus mengikutinya kemana-mana.","type":"vod","image_square":"","image_landscape":"https:\\/\\/op-picture.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/lands\\/1640157121_land.jpg","image_potrait":"https:\\/\\/op-picture.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/port\\/cadaver-(portrait).jpg"},{"no":"9","id":"3263","title":"The Hole in the Ground | Rated : R","slug":"the-hole-in-the-ground-rated-r","description":"Konten ini milik Cipta Mutu Entertainment (My Cinema). Seorang ibu yang tinggal di pedesaan Irlandia bersama putranya mulai curiga bahwa anaknya mungkin bukan anaknya yang sebenarnya, dan khawatir perilakunya yang semakin mengganggu terkait dengan lubang misterius di hutan belakang rumah mereka.","type":"vod","image_square":"","image_landscape":"https:\\/\\/op-picture.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/lands\\/1599030850_land.jpg","image_potrait":"https:\\/\\/op-picture.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/port\\/the-hole-in-the-ground549x825.jpg"},{"no":"10","id":"3214","title":"Malicious | Not Rated","slug":"malicious-not-rated","description":"Konten ini milik MovieWORLD. Seorang profesor muda dan istrinya yang sedang hamil tanpa disadari melepaskan entitas jahatnya dengan niat membunuh.","type":"vod","image_square":"","image_landscape":"https:\\/\\/op-picture.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/lands\\/1597050662_land.jpg","image_potrait":"https:\\/\\/op-picture.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/port\\/Malicious549x825.jpg"},{"no":"11","id":"2073","title":"Eloise | Rated : R","slug":"eloise-rated-r","description":"Konten ini milik Cipta Mutu Entertainment (My Cinema). Empat orang teman pergi ke rumah sakit jiwa yang telah ditinggalkan untuk mencari sertifikat kematian yang akan memberikan salah satu dari mereka warisan besar. ","type":"vod","image_square":"","image_landscape":"https:\\/\\/op-picture.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/lands\\/1632303694_land.jpg","image_potrait":"https:\\/\\/op-picture.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/port\\/eloise549x825.jpg"}]', 'N', '2024-01-22 14:25:04', '2024-02-01 06:26:15', '/top/section/inactivated_section'),
(23, '11 Comedy Sparks', '4', 'N', '', '[{"no":"1","id":"5942","title":"Wild Target | Rated : PG-13","slug":"wild-target-rated-pg-13","description":"Konten ini milik PT Cipta Mutu Entertainment. Seorang pembunuh bayaran mencoba untuk pensiun, tetapi seorang pencuri cantik dapat mengubah rencananya.","type":"vod","image_square":"","image_landscape":"https:\\/\\/op-picture.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/lands\\/1667551457_land.jpg","image_potrait":"https:\\/\\/op-picture.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/port\\/Wild-Target549x825.jpg"},{"no":"2","id":"3218","title":"Once Upon a Time in Venice | Not Rated","slug":"once-upon-a-time-in-venice-not-rated","description":"Konten ini milik MovieWORLD. Ketika sekelompok pengedar narkoba menangkap anjingnya Steve. Sebelum mengembalikan anjing itu, Spyder, pemimpin geng, mengatur agar Steve menyelesaikan beberapa tugas.","type":"vod","image_square":"","image_landscape":"https:\\/\\/op-picture.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/lands\\/1597050672_land.jpg","image_potrait":"https:\\/\\/op-picture.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/port\\/Once-Upon-a-Time-in-Venice549x825.jpg"},{"no":"3","id":"6526","title":"Mr Bones 2 | Rated : PG","slug":"mr-bones-2-rated-pg","description":"Konten ini milik PT Cipta Mutu Entertainment (My Family). Mr.Bones melakukan perjalanan ke masa depan untuk menemukan obat bagi Raja Hukule.","type":"vod","image_square":"","image_landscape":"https:\\/\\/op-picture.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/lands\\/1681283038_land.jpg","image_potrait":"https:\\/\\/op-picture.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/port\\/Mr-Bones-2_549x825.jpg"},{"no":"4","id":"5936","title":"Lucky Luke | Rated : PG","slug":"lucky-luke-rated-pg","description":"Konten ini milik PT Cipta Mutu Entertainment. Lucky Luke menjadi Sheriff of Daisy Town dan menghabisi semua penjahat. Kemudian saudara-saudara Dalton tiba dan mencoba membuat orang India melanggar perjanjian damai dan menyerang kota.","type":"vod","image_square":"","image_landscape":"https:\\/\\/op-picture.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/lands\\/1667552478_land.jpg","image_potrait":"https:\\/\\/op-picture.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/port\\/Lucky-Luke549x825.jpg"},{"no":"5","id":"5973","title":"Heart of Dragon | Rated : R","slug":"heart-of-dragon-rated-r","description":"Konten ini milik Celestial Tiger Entertainment (Kix). Ini adalah kisah yang menghangatkan hati dan menyentuh tentang persaudaraan antara seorang polisi top dan saudara laki-lakinya yang cacat mental.","type":"vod","image_square":"","image_landscape":"https:\\/\\/op-picture.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/lands\\/1668657946_land.jpg","image_potrait":"https:\\/\\/op-picture.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/port\\/Heart-of-Dragon549x825.jpg"},{"no":"6","id":"2281","title":"Voice | Rated : Not Rated","slug":"voice-rated-not-rated","description":"Konten ini milik Cipta Mutu Entertainment (My Cinema). Penyanyi muda berbakat (Kim Ok-bin) kembali dari kematian untuk menghantui para perempuan yang masih sekolah.","type":"vod","image_square":"","image_landscape":"https:\\/\\/op-picture.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/lands\\/1632368589_land.jpg","image_potrait":"https:\\/\\/op-picture.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/port\\/voice549x825.jpg"},{"no":"7","id":"5978","title":"My Kickass Wife | Rated : PG-13","slug":"my-kickass-wife-rated-pg-13","description":"Konten ini milik Celestial Tiger Entertainment (Celestial Movies). Jade (Michelle Hu) adalah pengawal kerajaan yang menawan namun penuh semangat. Ratu (Kerajaan Yuen) khawatir bahwa Raja mungkin akan mengincarnya, jadi dia menganugerahkan Jade gelar \\"Saudari Kerajaan\\" dan membantunya merekrut suami yang baik. Jade jatuh cinta pada kandidat bernama Sean (Benny Chan) pada pandangan pertama dan diam-diam membantunya memenangkan kontes dan mereka menikah. ","type":"vod","image_square":"","image_landscape":"https:\\/\\/op-picture.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/lands\\/1668588715_land.jpg","image_potrait":"https:\\/\\/op-picture.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/port\\/My-Kick-Ass-Wife549x825.jpg"},{"no":"8","id":"2818","title":"The Opposite Sex | Not Rated","slug":"the-opposite-sex-not-rated","description":"Konten ini milik Cipta Mutu Entertainment. Dua orang (Geoff Stults, Mena Suvari) memasuki serangkaian taruhan, di mana pemenangnya akan menentukan nasib yang kalah.","type":"vod","image_square":"","image_landscape":"https:\\/\\/op-picture.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/lands\\/1566555334_land.jpg","image_potrait":"https:\\/\\/op-picture.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/port\\/the-opposite-sex549x825.jpg"},{"no":"9","id":"3212","title":"Hot Tub Time Machine | Rated : R","slug":"hot-tub-time-machine-rated-r","description":"Konten ini milik MovieWORLD. Hot Tub Time Machine bercerita tentang sekelompok sahabat yang bosan dengan kehidupan mereka, dan mencoba untuk mengubahnya. ","type":"vod","image_square":"","image_landscape":"https:\\/\\/op-picture.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/lands\\/1596783698_land.jpg","image_potrait":"https:\\/\\/op-picture.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/port\\/Hot-Tub-Time-Machine549x825.jpg"},{"no":"10","id":"7843","title":"On Becoming a Man | Rated : PG","slug":"on-becoming-a-man-rated-pg","description":"Content Rights: Short TV.\\nSinopsis: Seorang anak laki-laki canggung berjuang untuk menemukan suaranya dan menghadapi keluarga mishuginanya pada hari-hari menjelang Bar Mitzvahnya.","type":"vod","image_square":"","image_landscape":"http:\\/\\/pic.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/lands\\/1702526562_land.jpg","image_potrait":"http:\\/\\/pic.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/port\\/on-becoming-a-man-(Potrait).jpg"},{"no":"11","id":"7650","title":"Roise & Frank | Rated : PG","slug":"roise-frank-rated-pg","description":"Content Rights: CinemaWorld.\\nSinopsis: \\"Roise & Frank\\" adalah sebuah film drama Irlandia tahun 2020 yang disutradarai oleh Rachael Moriarty. R\\u00f3ise yang baru saja ditinggal weduwe sedang berjuang dengan duka yang mendalam setelah suaminya meninggal. Namun, ketika seekor anjing liar mulai mengikutinya, ia mulai percaya bahwa mungkin anjing tersebut adalah reinkarnasi suaminya.","type":"vod","image_square":"","image_landscape":"http:\\/\\/pic.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/lands\\/ROISE-FRANK1280x720@3x.jpg","image_potrait":"http:\\/\\/pic.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/port\\/ROISE-FRANK549x825@3x.jpg"}]', 'N', '2024-01-22 15:10:09', '2024-02-01 06:29:51', '/top/section/inactivated_section'),
(24, '11 Playful Picks for Kids', '4', 'N', '', '[{"no":"1","id":"3217","title":"Mr. Go | Rated : PG","slug":"mr-go-rated-pg","description":"Konten ini milik MovieWORLD. Kisah Ling-ling, seekor gorila tua, yang terkenal karena dia bermain baseball di Liga Baseball Korea.","type":"vod","image_square":"","image_landscape":"https:\\/\\/op-picture.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/lands\\/1597050669_land.jpg","image_potrait":"https:\\/\\/op-picture.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/port\\/1598606907_port.jpg"},{"no":"2","id":"3283","title":"Dragon Hunters | Rated : PG","slug":"dragon-hunters-rated-pg","description":"Konten ini milik Cipta Mutu Entertainment (My Kidz). Kerajaan fantasi berada di bawah ancaman naga mengerikan yang kembali mengganggu mereka setiap 20 tahun. ","type":"vod","image_square":"","image_landscape":"https:\\/\\/op-picture.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/lands\\/1599640592_land.png","image_potrait":"https:\\/\\/op-picture.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/port\\/Dragon-Hunters549x825.png"},{"no":"3","id":"2883","title":"Rock Dog | Rated : PG","slug":"rock-dog-rated-pg","description":"Konten ini milik Cipta Mutu Entertainment (My Kidz). Ketika sebuah radio jatuh dari langit ke tangan Tibetan Mastiff, dia meninggalkan rumah untuk memenuhi mimpinya menjadi seorang musisi.","type":"vod","image_square":"","image_landscape":"https:\\/\\/op-picture.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/lands\\/1570781447_land.jpg","image_potrait":"https:\\/\\/op-picture.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/port\\/Rock-Dog549x825.jpg"},{"no":"4","id":"3282","title":"Chicken Run | Rated : G","slug":"chicken-run-rated-g","description":"Konten ini milik Cipta Mutu Entertainment (My Kidz). Ketika seekor ayam jantan datang ke sebuah peternakan ayam, ayam-ayam disana melihatnya sebagai kesempatan untuk melarikan diri dari pemiliknya yang jahat.","type":"vod","image_square":"","image_landscape":"https:\\/\\/op-picture.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/lands\\/1599640595_land.png","image_potrait":"https:\\/\\/op-picture.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/port\\/Chicken-Run549x825.png"},{"no":"5","id":"6804","title":"Bear Story | Rated : PG-13","slug":"bear-story-rated-pg-13","description":"Konten ini milik Shorts TV. Pemenang Oscar. Setiap hari, seekor beruang tua yang melankolis membawa diorama mekanis yang telah ia ciptakan ke sudut jalannya. Untuk koin, orang yang lewat dapat melihat penemuannya.","type":"vod","image_square":"","image_landscape":"https:\\/\\/op-picture.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/lands\\/1687410283_land.jpg","image_potrait":"https:\\/\\/op-picture.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/port\\/bear-story-(potrait).jpg"},{"no":"6","id":"6258","title":"A Short Story of A FOX | Rated : SU","slug":"a-short-story-of-a-fox-rated-su","description":"Konten ini milik Shorts TV. Rubah kesepian memburu tikus dan hubungan mereka akan berkembang saat dua burung hantu mengganggu perburuan.","type":"vod","image_square":"","image_landscape":"https:\\/\\/op-picture.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/lands\\/a-short-story-of-a-fox-and-mouse-(landscapes).jpg","image_potrait":"https:\\/\\/op-picture.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/port\\/a-short-story-of-a-fox-and-a-mouse-(potrait).jpg"},{"no":"7","id":"4046","title":"The Tower | Rated : PG-13","slug":"the-tower-rated-pg-13","description":"Konten ini milik CinemaWorld. The Tower adalah film animasi Norwegia tahun 2018 yang disutradarai oleh Mats Grorud. Berdasarkan kisah nyata yang diceritakan kembali oleh para pengungsi Palestina, animasi ini berfokus pada kehidupan Wardi yang berusia 11 tahun di sebuah kamp Lebanon. Suatu hari, kakek buyutnya mempercayakannya kunci rumah leluhur mereka kepadanya.","type":"vod","image_square":"","image_landscape":"https:\\/\\/op-picture.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/lands\\/1626079509_land.jpg","image_potrait":"https:\\/\\/op-picture.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/port\\/THE-TOWER549x825 (1).jpg"},{"no":"8","id":"2230","title":"The New Adventures of Aladdin | Not Rated","slug":"the-new-adventures-of-aladdin-not-rated","description":"Konten ini milik C