/\\/op-picture.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/port\\/Lucky-Break.png"},{"no":"8","id":"3961","title":"Lapland Odyssey | Not Rated","slug":"lapland-odyssey-not-rated","description":"Konten ini milik My Cinema Europe. Janne tidak bisa mengendalikan hidupnya. Pacarnya Inari memberinya ultimatum yang mengirim Janne dan teman-temannya dalam perjalanan dengan banyak tantangan, rintangan dan godaan.\\n","type":"vod","image_square":"","image_landscape":"https:\\/\\/op-picture.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/lands\\/1624435165_land.png","image_potrait":"https:\\/\\/op-picture.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/port\\/Lapland-Odyssey.png"},{"no":"9","id":"3963","title":"Kryptonite | Rated : PG-13","slug":"kryptonite-rated-pg-13","description":"Konten ini milik My Cinema Europe. Peppino Sansone yang berusia sembilan tahun memiliki keluarga besar yang kacau balau dan sepupu yang lebih tua, Gennaro, mengira dia Superman!","type":"vod","image_square":"","image_landscape":"https:\\/\\/op-picture.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/lands\\/1634025008_land.jpg","image_potrait":"https:\\/\\/op-picture.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/port\\/Kryptonite.jpg"},{"no":"10","id":"6526","title":"Mr Bones 2 | Rated : PG","slug":"mr-bones-2-rated-pg","description":"Konten ini milik PT Cipta Mutu Entertainment (My Family). Mr.Bones melakukan perjalanan ke masa depan untuk menemukan obat bagi Raja Hukule.","type":"vod","image_square":"","image_landscape":"https:\\/\\/op-picture.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/lands\\/1681283038_land.jpg","image_potrait":"https:\\/\\/op-picture.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/port\\/Mr-Bones-2_549x825.jpg"}]', 'N', '2024-04-02 11:07:08', '2024-04-30 08:17:23', '/top/section/inactivated_section'),
(33, 'Unlock the May-steries', '4', 'N', '', '[{"no":"1","id":"7285","title":"Memoir | Rated : PG-13","slug":"memoir-rated-pg-13","description":"Content Rights: Thrill.\\nSinopsis: Kehidupan Duranee, seorang pekerja di toko serba ada, berubah. Semua karena ia bertemu dengan Yo, tokoh misterius yang Duranee jadikan target untuk membuat Yo membeli asuransi darinya.","type":"vod","image_square":"","image_landscape":"http:\\/\\/pic.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/lands\\/Memoir1280x720@3x.jpg","image_potrait":"http:\\/\\/pic.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/port\\/Memoir549x825@3x.jpg"},{"no":"2","id":"2859","title":"The Invitation | Not Rated","slug":"the-invitation-not-rated","description":"Konten ini milik Cipta Mutu Entertainment (My Cinema). Seorang pria menerima undangan ke pesta makan malam yang diselenggarakan oleh mantan istrinya, perselingkuhan yang meresahkan membuka kembali luka lama dan menciptakan ketegangan baru.","type":"vod","image_square":"","image_landscape":"https:\\/\\/op-picture.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/lands\\/1632381629_land.jpg","image_potrait":"https:\\/\\/op-picture.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/port\\/the-invitation549x825 (1).jpg"},{"no":"3","id":"2370","title":"Nightmare High Ep. 01","slug":"nightmare-high-ep-01","description":"Kim Seul-gi yang dikucilkan mendapat popularitasnya.\\n","type":"vod","image_square":"","image_landscape":"http:\\/\\/pic.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/lands\\/nh Land.jpg","image_potrait":"http:\\/\\/pic.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/port\\/nh pot.jpg"},{"no":"4","id":"6894","title":"Model Family | Rated : PG-13","slug":"model-family-rated-pg-13","description":"Konten ini milik Celestial Tiger Entertainment (Thrill). Keluarga orang tua tunggal (Yu Xiang dan Tong Tong) pindah ke lingkungan baru di mana kehidupan setiap orang tampak sempurna. Namun, sementara hal-hal mungkin terlihat cerah di luar, rahasia gelap dan horor menyerang setiap keluarga dari dalam, dan tidak ada yang benar-benar seperti yang terlihat.","type":"vod","image_square":"","image_landscape":"https:\\/\\/op-picture.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/lands\\/Model-Family1280x720@3x.jpg","image_potrait":"https:\\/\\/op-picture.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/port\\/Model-Family549x825@3x.jpg"},{"no":"5","id":"3972","title":"Korkoro | Rated : PG-13","slug":"korkoro-rated-pg-13","description":"Konten ini milik My Cinema Europe. Sebuah keluarga melakukan perjalanan ke Perancis pada masa Perang Dunia II, diikuti oleh cerita Claude, seorang anak laki-laki yang mencari keluarga baru setelah orang tuanya pergi dan tidak pernah kembali.","type":"vod","image_square":"","image_landscape":"https:\\/\\/op-picture.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/lands\\/1624439572_land.png","image_potrait":"https:\\/\\/op-picture.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/port\\/Korkoro.png"},{"no":"6","id":"2256","title":"Mr. Holmes | Rated : PG","slug":"mr-holmes-rated-pg","description":"Konten ini adalah milik CinemaBOX. Holmes yang berusia 93 tahun berjuang untuk mengingat detail kasus terakhirnya karena pikirannya perlahan memburuk.","type":"vod","image_square":"","image_landscape":"https:\\/\\/op-picture.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/lands\\/1558079070_land.jpg","image_potrait":"https:\\/\\/op-picture.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/port\\/1561565394_port.jpg"},{"no":"7","id":"6023","title":"ASLEEP | Rated : PG-13","slug":"asleep-rated-pg-13","description":"Konten ini milik Shorts TV. Membayangkan cinta dan hubungan dalam waktu dekat.","type":"vod","image_square":"","image_landscape":"https:\\/\\/op-picture.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/lands\\/a-sleep.jpg","image_potrait":"https:\\/\\/op-picture.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/port\\/asleep-potraiit.jpg"},{"no":"8","id":"6628","title":"Aiyai: Wrathful Soul | Rated : PG-13","slug":"aiyai-wrathful-soul-rated-pg-13","description":"Konten ini milik Celestial Tiger Entertainment (Thrill). Sebuah lingkungan diganggu oleh tragedi misterius ketika seorang pemuda menjadi saluran bagi roh tak dikenal, ''AIYAI'' yang memikat para korban ke nasib mengerikan mereka.","type":"vod","image_square":"","image_landscape":"https:\\/\\/op-picture.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/lands\\/1683272830_land.jpg","image_potrait":"https:\\/\\/op-picture.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/port\\/UntitSSled-2.jpg"},{"no":"9","id":"2280","title":"Berlin Syndrome | Rated : R","slug":"berlin-syndrome-rated-r","description":"Konten ini milik Cipta Mutu Entertainment (My Cinema). Seorang jurnalis foto Australia terbangun pada suatu pagi di sebuah apartemen di Berlin, dan dia tidak dapat pergi kemana-mana.","type":"vod","image_square":"","image_landscape":"https:\\/\\/op-picture.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/lands\\/1632368335_land.jpg","image_potrait":"https:\\/\\/op-picture.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/port\\/berlin-syndrome549x825.jpg"},{"no":"10","id":"2816","title":"Wonderstruck | Rated : PG","slug":"wonderstruck-rated-pg","description":"Konten ini milik Cipta Mutu Entertainment. Film ini menjalin dua cerita yang berjarak lima puluh tahun. Masing-masing menceritakan kisah pencarian seorang anak pada tahun 1927 dan 1977.","type":"vod","image_square":"","image_landscape":"https:\\/\\/op-picture.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/lands\\/1566555341_land.jpg","image_potrait":"https:\\/\\/op-picture.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/port\\/wonderstruck549x825.jpg"}]', 'N', '2024-05-03 13:50:21', '2024-06-03 03:52:20', '/top/section/inactivated_section'),
(34, 'It''s the Teen Ride!', '4', 'N', '', '[{"no":"1","id":"8316","title":"Fall in Love at First Kiss | Rated : PG","slug":"fall-in-love-at-first-kiss-rated-pg","description":"Content Rights: PT Cipta Mutu (My Cinema Asia).\\nSinopsis: Diadaptasi dari serial manga Jepang \\"Itazura na Kiss\\", tentang seorang gadis remaja yang jatuh cinta dengan sesama seniornya sejak hari pertama mereka di sekolah menengah.","type":"vod","image_square":"","image_landscape":"http:\\/\\/pic.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/lands\\/Fall-in-Love-at-First-Kiss1280x720@3x.jpg","image_potrait":"http:\\/\\/pic.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/port\\/Fall-in-Love-at-First-Kiss549x825@3x.jpg"},{"no":"2","id":"2252","title":"Whip It | Rated : PG-13","slug":"whip-it-rated-pg-13","description":"Konten ini milik Cipta Mutu Entertainment. Di Bodeen, Texas, seorang pecinta musik rock indie menemukan cara untuk mengatasi kesengsaraan kota kecil setelah menemukan liga roller derby di dekat Austin.","type":"vod","image_square":"","image_landscape":"https:\\/\\/op-picture.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/lands\\/1558084053_land.jpg","image_potrait":"https:\\/\\/op-picture.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/port\\/1561566242_port.jpg"},{"no":"3","id":"2969","title":"That Girl in Pinafore | Rated : PG","slug":"that-girl-in-pinafore-rated-pg","description":"Konten ini milik Celestial Tiger Entertainment (Celestial Movies). Seorang remaja mencoba untuk mengadaptasi gaya hidup baru ke dalam pub musik bangsa yang sedang berjuang.","type":"vod","image_square":"","image_landscape":"https:\\/\\/op-picture.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/lands\\/1579775163_land.jpg","image_potrait":"https:\\/\\/op-picture.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/port\\/That-Girl-in-Pinafore549x825 (1).jpg"},{"no":"4","id":"2169","title":"Boychoir | Rated : PG-13","slug":"boychoir-rated-pg-13","description":"Konten ini milik MovieWORLD. Seorang remaja (Garrett Wareing) dengan bakat luar biasa ditantang oleh seorang guru vokal (Dustin Hoffman).","type":"vod","image_square":"","image_landscape":"https:\\/\\/op-picture.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/lands\\/1556269238_land.jpg","image_potrait":"https:\\/\\/op-picture.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/port\\/Boychoir.jpg"},{"no":"5","id":"2173","title":"Yoga Hosers | Rated : PG-13","slug":"yoga-hosers-rated-pg-13","description":"Konten ini milik MovieWORLD. Dua remaja bekerja sama dengan seorang pemburu legendaris untuk menghadapi ancaman yang mengancam pesta besar mereka.","type":"vod","image_square":"","image_landscape":"https:\\/\\/op-picture.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/lands\\/1556791678_land.jpg","image_potrait":"https:\\/\\/op-picture.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/port\\/Yoga-Hosers549x825 (1).jpg"},{"no":"6","id":"6249","title":"The Right Turn | Rated : PG-13","slug":"the-right-turn-rated-pg-13","description":"Konten ini milik Shorts TV. THE RIGHT TURN adalah komedi dewasa tentang cobaan berkencan. Seorang anak laki-laki SMA yang tidak percaya diri mengajak seorang gadis berkencan dan tidak bisa menutup kesepakatan dengan ciuman. Frustrasi dia menyalakan GPS yang secara misterius melakukan lebih dari sekadar membimbingnya pulang.","type":"vod","image_square":"","image_landscape":"https:\\/\\/op-picture.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/lands\\/the-right-turn-(landscapes).jpg","image_potrait":"https:\\/\\/op-picture.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/port\\/the-right-turn-(potrait).jpg"},{"no":"7","id":"3087","title":"Revenge Note Ep. 01","slug":"revenge-note-ep-01","description":"Setelah dicampakkan oleh pacarnya, Ho Goo-Hee mengaku pada teman barunya, Jung Deok-Hee.  \\n","type":"vod","image_square":"","image_landscape":"http:\\/\\/pic.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/lands\\/3@3x (1).jpg","image_potrait":"http:\\/\\/pic.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/port\\/3.2@3x.jpg"},{"no":"8","id":"7934","title":"Your Playlist Eps.1","slug":"your-playlist-eps1","description":"Sinopsis: Sebuah drama musik yang mengisahkan tentang seorang komposer misterius, seorang penggemar, dan persahabatan melalui daftar putar musik di media sosial.","type":"vod","image_square":"","image_landscape":"http:\\/\\/pic.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/lands\\/EP 1@3x(2).jpg","image_potrait":"http:\\/\\/pic.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/port\\/4@3x (2).jpg"},{"no":"9","id":"4021","title":"Shana : The Wolf''s Music | Rated : PG","slug":"shana-the-wolfs-music-rated-pg","description":"Konten ini milik My Cinema Europe. Sejak kematian ibunya dua tahun lalu, Shana yang berusia 13 tahun merasa kesepian. Dengan biolanya dan bantuan serigala putih, dia menemukan jalan kembali ke kehidupan.","type":"vod","image_square":"","image_landscape":"https:\\/\\/op-picture.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/lands\\/1625134247_land.png","image_potrait":"https:\\/\\/op-picture.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/port\\/Shana-The-Wolfs-Music.png"},{"no":"10","id":"6555","title":"Crazy For You | Rated : PG-13","slug":"crazy-for-you-rated-pg-13","description":"Konten ini milik ShortsTV. Sulit untuk menemukan cinta ketika Anda seorang pembunuh berantai, jadi ketika Charlie bertemu dengan gadis impiannya, dia harus merahasiakan kekurangan itu. Akankah cinta sejati memenangkan hari? Atau akankah dia menjadi salah satu korbannya?","type":"vod","image_square":"","image_landscape":"https:\\/\\/op-picture.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/lands\\/1681791578_land.jpg","image_potrait":"https:\\/\\/op-picture.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/port\\/crazy-for-you-(potrait).jpg"}]', 'N', '2024-06-04 11:42:05', '2024-07-01 04:10:47', '/top/section/inactivated_section'),
(35, 'Kids Adventures Await!', '4', 'N', '', '[{"no":"1","id":"3276","title":"Bolts & Blip | Rated : PG","slug":"bolts-blip-rated-pg","description":"Konten ini milik Cipta Mutu Entertainment (My Kidz). Bolts & Blip, yang secara tidak sengaja menemukan diri mereka sebagai anggota tim urutan terakhir Liga Lunar, Thunderbolt.","type":"vod","image_square":"","image_landscape":"https://op-picture.dens.tv/poster/files/lands/1599640597_land.png","image_potrait":""},{"no":"2","id":"2203","title":"Dragon Nest : Warrior''s Dawn | Rated : PG","slug":"dragon-nest-warriors-dawn-rated-pg","description":"Konten ini milik Cipta Mutu Entertainment (My Kidz). Lambert bergabung dengan Dragon Slayers'' League untuk menyelamatkan Altera dari Black Dragon.","type":"vod","image_square":"","image_landscape":"https://op-picture.dens.tv/poster/files/lands/1637581345_land.jpg","image_potrait":""},{"no":"3","id":"3278","title":"Nine (9) | Rated : PG-13","slug":"nine-9-rated-pg13","description":"Konten ini milik Cipta Mutu Entertainment (My Kidz). Setelah perang apokaliptik antara manusia dan mesin, dunia benar-benar hancur dan tidak ada kehidupan manusia. Namun, ragdoll terbangun dan memegang kunci keselamatan umat manusia.","type":"vod","image_square":"","image_landscape":"https://op-picture.dens.tv/poster/files/lands/1599640590_land.png","image_potrait":""},{"no":"4","id":"2174","title":"Earth to Echo | Rated : PG","slug":"earth-to-echo-rated-pg","description":"Konten ini milik MovieWORLD. Setelah menerima serangkaian pesan yang aneh, sekelompok anak memulai petualangan dengan alien yang membutuhkan bantuan mereka.","type":"vod","image_square":"","image_landscape":"","image_potrait":"https://op-picture.dens.tv/poster/files/port/Earth-to-Echo.jpg"},{"no":"5","id":"2179","title":"Stand by Me Doraemon | Rated : PG","slug":"stand-by-me-doraemon-rated-pg","description":"Konten ini milik MovieWORLD. Nobita mencoba memperbaiki kehidupannya di masa kini agar Doraemon bisa Kembali ke rumahnya di masa depan.","type":"vod","image_square":"","image_landscape":"https://op-picture.dens.tv/poster/files/lands/1556785141_land.jpg","image_potrait":""},{"no":"6","id":"2178","title":"The Journey Home (Midnight Sun) | Rated : PG","slug":"the-journey-home-midnight-sun-rated-pg","description":"Konten ini milik MovieWORLD. Seorang anak laki-laki menyatukan kembali seekor anak beruang kutub yang ditinggalkan dengan ibunya di ladang es di Kanada Utara.","type":"vod","image_square":"","image_landscape":"https://op-picture.dens.tv/poster/files/lands/1556786396_land.jpg","image_potrait":""},{"no":"7","id":"6656","title":"Miles Away | Rated : PG-13","slug":"miles-away-rated-pg13","description":"Konten ini milik ShortsTV. Miles adalah seorang anak kecil yang sahabatnya adalah pohon. Bersama-sama mereka melakukan perjalanan darat dan menikmati hari musim panas yang sempurna di pasar malam.","type":"vod","image_square":"","image_landscape":"https://op-picture.dens.tv/poster/files/lands/1684310431_land.jpg","image_potrait":""},{"no":"8","id":"8286","title":"One Small Step | Rated : PG","slug":"one-small-step-rated-pg","description":"Content Rights: Shorts TV.\\nSinopsis: TAIKO Studios mempersembahkan kisah Luna, seorang gadis Amerika keturunan Cina yang bermimpi menjadi astronot.","type":"vod","image_square":"","image_landscape":"http://pic.dens.tv/poster/files/lands/1714107298_land.jpg","image_potrait":""},{"no":"9","id":"8071","title":"Toki and Dewei | Rated : PG","slug":"toki-and-dewei-rated-pg","description":"Content Rights: Shorts TV.\\nSinopsis: Seorang anak laki-laki bermimpi bersama sahabat petualangan dan pahlawan supernya. Mereka akan menyadari bahwa persahabatan mereka memiliki nilai lebih dari ambisi masa kecilnya.","type":"vod","image_square":"","image_landscape":"http://pic.dens.tv/poster/files/lands/1708589347_land.jpg","image_potrait":""},{"no":"10","id":"7601","title":"The Bird and The Whale | Rated : PG-13","slug":"the-bird-and-the-whale-rated-pg13","description":"Con