en ini milik MovieWORLD. Seorang anak laki-laki menyatukan kembali seekor anak beruang kutub yang ditinggalkan dengan ibunya di ladang es di Kanada Utara.","type":"vod","image_square":"","image_landscape":"https:\\/\\/op-picture.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/lands\\/1556786396_land.jpg","image_potrait":"https:\\/\\/op-picture.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/port\\/The-Journey-Home.jpg","trailer_url":""},{"no":"9","id":"4178","title":"Tim | Rated : G","slug":"tim-rated-g","description":"Konten ini milik Shorts TV. Timothy Gray ingin menjadi seperti Tim Burton saat dewasa nanti. \\n","type":"vod","image_square":"","image_landscape":"https:\\/\\/op-picture.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/lands\\/1627295189_land.png","image_potrait":"https:\\/\\/op-picture.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/port\\/Tim (1).png","trailer_url":""},{"no":"10","id":"7601","title":"The Bird and The Whale | Rated : PG-13","slug":"the-bird-and-the-whale-rated-pg-13","description":"Content Rights: Shorts TV.\\nSinopsis: Seekor anak paus yang terpisah dari keluarganya menemukan seekor burung yang terkurung, satu-satunya yang selamat dari tenggelamnya kapal. Bersama-sama, mereka berjuang untuk bertahan hidup, tersesat di laut.","type":"vod","image_square":"","image_landscape":"http:\\/\\/pic.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/lands\\/1698217203_land.jpg","image_potrait":"http:\\/\\/pic.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/port\\/the-bird-and-the-whale-(Potrait).jpg","trailer_url":""}]', 'N', '2024-07-04 14:27:10', '2024-08-01 06:34:29', '/top/section/inactivated_section'),
(37, 'Jingle on the Screen!', '4', 'N', '', '[{"no":"1","id":"8497","title":"Holiday Wishes | Rated : PG","slug":"holiday-wishes-rated-pg","description":"Content Rights: PT Cipta Mutu Entertainment (My Family).\\nSinopsis: Danni Hartford, perencana pesta keluarga King, ingin menemukan saudara perempuannya. Britney, putri 15 tahun yang manja dari keluarga King, ingin memiliki kuda.","type":"vod","image_square":"","image_landscape":"http:\\/\\/pic.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/lands\\/Holiday-Wishes1280x720@3x.jpg","image_potrait":"http:\\/\\/pic.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/port\\/Holiday-Wishes549x825@3x.jpg","trailer_url":""},{"no":"2","id":"6152","title":"Taste Good Eps. 01 - Perfect Salmon For Christmas","slug":"taste-good-eps-01-perfect-salmon-for-christmas","description":"Pada Natal tahun ini, Chef Ayu rindu masakan-masakan yang pernah dibuat keluarganya. Salah satunya Nasi Salmon Nori dengan masakan yang lezat dan sederhana membuat iri adiknya sedang jauh di rumah.","type":"vod","image_square":"","image_landscape":"https:\\/\\/op-picture.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/lands\\/1671703235_land.jpg","image_potrait":"https:\\/\\/op-picture.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/port\\/01-Portrait-VOD-Per-episode_Taste-Good.jpg","trailer_url":""},{"no":"3","id":"2251","title":"A Bad Moms Christmas | Rated : R","slug":"a-bad-moms-christmas-rated-r","description":"Konten ini milik Cipta Mutu Entertainment. Bercerita tentang tiga ibu yang terlalu banyak bekerja, tetapi kurang dihargai.","type":"vod","image_square":"","image_landscape":"https:\\/\\/op-picture.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/lands\\/1558065600_land.jpg","image_potrait":"https:\\/\\/op-picture.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/port\\/1561566375_port.jpg","trailer_url":""},{"no":"4","id":"2527","title":"Journey to the Christmas Star | Rated : G","slug":"journey-to-the-christmas-star-rated-g","description":"Konten ini milik Cipta Mutu Entertainment (My Kidz). Seorang gadis pemberani yang melakukan perjalanan berbahaya mencari Christmas Star untuk membebaskan kerajaan dari kutukan dan membawa kembali seorang putri yang telah lama hilang.","type":"vod","image_square":"","image_landscape":"https:\\/\\/op-picture.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/lands\\/1639551693_land.jpg","image_potrait":"https:\\/\\/op-picture.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/port\\/journey-to-the-christmas-star549x825.jpg","trailer_url":""},{"no":"5","id":"6153","title":"Taste Good Eps. 02 - Holy Jolly Christmas Chicken","slug":"taste-good-eps-02-holy-jolly-christmas-chicken","description":"Selain Nasi Salmon Nori, Chef Ayu rindu dengan masakan Indian Butter Chicken. Seperti namanya Indian Butter Chicken yaitu masakan dengan ciri menggunakan rempah-rempah khas India dengan cita rasa aroma yang tajam.","type":"vod","image_square":"","image_landscape":"https:\\/\\/op-picture.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/lands\\/1671703397_land.jpg","image_potrait":"https:\\/\\/op-picture.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/port\\/02-Portrait-VOD-Per-episode_Taste-Good.jpg","trailer_url":""},{"no":"6","id":"2231","title":"Le pere Noel (Santa Claus) | Not Rated","slug":"le-pere-noel-santa-claus-not-rated","description":"Konten ini milik Cipta Mutu Entertainment. Seorang anak laki-laki berusia 6 tahun yang menginginkan naik kereta luncur bersama Sinterklas.","type":"vod","image_square":"","image_landscape":"https:\\/\\/op-picture.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/lands\\/1558076196_land.jpg","image_potrait":"https:\\/\\/op-picture.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/port\\/1561569891_port.jpg","trailer_url":""},{"no":"7","id":"2232","title":"The Christmas Candle | Rated : PG","slug":"the-christmas-candle-rated-pg","description":"Konten ini milik Cipta Mutu Entertainment. Seorang pendeta menerima posisi di sebuah kota yang percaya pada keajaiban lilin Natal.\\n","type":"vod","image_square":"","image_landscape":"https:\\/\\/op-picture.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/lands\\/1558079572_land.jpg","image_potrait":"https:\\/\\/op-picture.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/port\\/1561569727_port.jpg","trailer_url":""},{"no":"8","id":"6343","title":"The Christmas Hot Dog | Rated : PG-13","slug":"the-christmas-hot-dog-rated-pg-13","description":"Konten ini milik Shorts TV. Ego bersatu dalam rencana untuk mengubah Natal menjadi Januari. Hanya ada satu masalah, Will telah menemukan seorang wanita yang membagikan hot dog gratis dan minatnya untuk menemukannya dapat menggagalkan motivasi dari seluruh acara spesial Natal.","type":"vod","image_square":"","image_landscape":"https:\\/\\/op-picture.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/lands\\/1676875867_land.jpg","image_potrait":"https:\\/\\/op-picture.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/port\\/the-christmas-hotdog-(potrait).jpg","trailer_url":""},{"no":"9","id":"1649","title":"Magic Silver | Rated : PG","slug":"magic-silver-rated-pg","description":"Konten ini milik Cipta Mutu Entertainment (My Kidz). Putri Bluerose harus menyelamatkan nyawa ayahnya, Raja Gnome Biru, dan mengambil kembali Magic Silver yang membawa cahaya matahari ke bumi.\\n","type":"vod","image_square":"","image_landscape":"https:\\/\\/op-picture.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/lands\\/1637570939_land.jpg","image_potrait":"https:\\/\\/op-picture.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/port\\/magic-silver549x825.jpg","trailer_url":""},{"no":"10","id":"1741","title":"Niko & the Way to the Stars | Rated : G","slug":"niko-the-way-to-the-stars-rated-g","description":"Konten ini milik Cipta Mutu Entertainment (My Kidz). Seekor rusa melakukan pencarian untuk menemukan dan menyelamatkan ayahnya, yang dia yakini sebagai anggota Pasukan Terbang Elit Sinterklas yang terkenal di dunia.","type":"vod","image_square":"","image_landscape":"https:\\/\\/op-picture.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/lands\\/1637568398_land.jpg","image_potrait":"https:\\/\\/op-picture.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/port\\/Niko-and-the-way-to-the-stars549x825.jpg","trailer_url":""}]', 'N', '2024-08-01 13:38:29', '2024-12-19 10:27:00', '/top/section/inactivated_section');
