ainment (My Cinema Asia). \\nSinopsis: Death Bell 2: Bloody Camp adalah tentang sekelompok siswa dan guru sekolah menengah yang terkunci di dalam sekolah setelah instruktur renang dibunuh.","type":"vod","image_square":"","image_landscape":"http:\\/\\/pic.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/lands\\/Deathbell II Land@3x.jpg","image_potrait":"http:\\/\\/pic.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/port\\/DeathBell II Pot@3x (1).jpg","trailer_url":""},{"no":"7","id":"6232","title":"Sadako 2 | Rated : PG-13","slug":"sadako-2-rated-pg-13","description":"Konten ini milik PT Cipta Mutu (My Cinema Asia). Fuko Ando diminta mengurus keponakannya yang berusia 4 tahun. Namun dia tidak menyangka hal ini membuatnya menghadapi peristiwa mengerikan dari video terkutuk yang ditemukannya.","type":"vod","image_square":"","image_landscape":"https:\\/\\/op-picture.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/lands\\/1674119463_land.jpg","image_potrait":"https:\\/\\/op-picture.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/port\\/Sadako2_549x825.jpg","trailer_url":""},{"no":"8","id":"3220","title":"The Cured | Rated : R","slug":"the-cured-rated-r","description":"Konten ini milik MovieWORLD. Penyakit yang mengubah manusia menjadi zombie telah disembuhkan. Orang yang pernah terinfeksi didiskriminasi oleh masyarakat dan keluarga mereka sendiri, yang menyebabkan masalah sosial muncul.\\n","type":"vod","image_square":"","image_landscape":"https:\\/\\/op-picture.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/lands\\/1597224649_land.jpg","image_potrait":"https:\\/\\/op-picture.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/port\\/The-Cured549x825.jpg","trailer_url":""},{"no":"9","id":"2135","title":"Paranormal Activity | Rated : R","slug":"paranormal-activity-rated-r","description":"Konten ini milik MovieWORLD. Film ini fokus pada pasangan muda, Katie dan Micah yang dihantui oleh kehadiran supernatural di rumah mereka.","type":"vod","image_square":"","image_landscape":"https:\\/\\/op-picture.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/lands\\/1556597636_land.jpg","image_potrait":"https:\\/\\/op-picture.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/port\\/Paranormal-Activity.jpg","trailer_url":""},{"no":"10","id":"3209","title":"Bad Samaritan | Rated : R","slug":"bad-samaritan-rated-r","description":"Konten ini milik MovieWORLD. Pemarkir mobil valet mengembangkan penipuan untuk merampok rumah. Semuanya berjalan lancar sampai dia merampok pria yang salah dan menemukan seorang wanita yang ditawan. ","type":"vod","image_square":"","image_landscape":"https:\\/\\/op-picture.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/lands\\/1596783696_land.jpg","image_potrait":"https:\\/\\/op-picture.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/port\\/Bad-Samaritan549x825.jpg","trailer_url":""}]', 'N', '2024-12-19 17:34:31', '2025-01-13 02:54:12', '/top/section/inactivated_section'),
(47, 'Cerita Pendek Pilihan Akhir Tahun', '4', 'N', '', '[{"no":"1","id":"8912","title":"Cupcakes | Rated : PG-13","slug":"cupcakes-rated-pg-13","description":"Content Rights: Shorts TV.\\nSinopsis: Kisah seorang anak kecil dan cara uniknya untuk mendapatkan satu keinginannya, ''cupcake''. Namun, mengapa keinginannya tidak pernah terwujud?","type":"vod","image_square":"","image_landscape":"http:\\/\\/pic.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/lands\\/SAA023803_LS.jpg","image_potrait":"http:\\/\\/pic.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/port\\/SAA023803.jpg","trailer_url":""},{"no":"2","id":"8599","title":"Still With You | Rated : PG-13","slug":"still-with-you-rated-pg-13","description":"Content Rights: Shorts TV.\\nSinopsis: Sebuah animasi yang menginspirasi. Suatu malam, teman anjing Ollie si kucing, Sam, melarikan diri ke belantara bersalju. Kucing yang penuh semangat itu mencari temannya sebelum dia hilang selamanya.","type":"vod","image_square":"","image_landscape":"http:\\/\\/pic.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/lands\\/SAA025155_LS.jpg","image_potrait":"http:\\/\\/pic.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/port\\/SAA025155.jpg","trailer_url":""},{"no":"3","id":"8798","title":"How My Dad Killed Dracula | Rated : PG","slug":"how-my-dad-killed-dracula-rated-pg","description":"Content Rights: Shorts TV.\\nSinopsis: notorious of vampires.\\nChatGPT said:\\nChatGPT\\nSetelah malam trick or treating, beberapa anak mengagumi hasil jerih payah mereka ketika salah satu ayah mereka menceritakan kisah bagaimana dia membunuh vampir paling terkenal.","type":"vod","image_square":"","image_landscape":"http:\\/\\/pic.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/lands\\/SAA025414_LS.jpg","image_potrait":"http:\\/\\/pic.dens.tv\\/poster\\/files\\/port\\/SAA025414.jpg","trailer_url":""},{"no":"4","id":"9016","title":"Perayaan Natal: Uniknya tradisi di Indonesia","slug":"perayaan-natal-uniknya-tradisi-di-indonesia","description":"Sinopsis: Berbagai tradisi perayaan Natal di Indonesia","type":"vod","image_square":"","image_landscape":"htt